Description: Mission OS system security policy daemon
 mission-securityd manages firewall configuration (nftables backend),
 security event auditing, PolKit authorization for security operations,
 and audit log management.
 .
 This package contains the system security daemon, D-Bus configuration,
 and PolKit policy files.
